---
import ContactList from "../components/ContactList.astro";
import { career, contact } from "../data/site";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/url";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm a software engineer, and I treat work as a sandbox for growing and making things I care about. Most of what
      I've learned at work, I end up using everywhere else.
    </p>
    <p>
      Over time I've found I like building tools and being close to the people who use them. To me, full stack starts
      with the user: what they need, how that meets what the business needs, and which features are worth building.
      Then I sequence it, build it, test it, and own it.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most recently I built the chat agent at Assembled. Earlier I built workspace and collaboration features at
      Notion. At Amazon I worked on Prime Gaming, where I led the frontend redesign of gaming.amazon.com and built
      developer tools for localization, country launches, telemetry, and A/B testing. Before that I worked on social
      features at Sonder Social. I studied statistics and actuarial math at UCLA and started in finance as a risk and
      quantitative analyst at Capital Group.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside work, I make small sites and tools about whatever I'm curious about. They're all on the
      <a href={withBase()}>projects page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section aria-labelledby="work-heading">
    <h2 id="work-heading">Work</h2>
    <ul role="list">
      {
        career.map((item) => (
          <li>
            {item.org} <span class="muted">· {item.role} · {item.dates}</span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
    <h2 id="contact-heading">Contact</h2>
    <ContactList links={contact} />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-m);
  }

  .prose > * + * {
    margin-top: var(--space-s);
  }

  section {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-s);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
</style>
